{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#card-zh","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH++ 是 DeepSeek Harness 的本机运维工具，提供 CLI、网页控制台和 /dshpp 插件命令。它可查看会话用量与费用估算、管理模型提供方、备份恢复配置，并运行工作流回归检查。它还可列出会话记录并导出会话文本，网页端提供环境项、备份、提供方和用量的管理入口。适合希望在本机查看和维护 DSH 状态的用户，需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-33","bin/dshpp.mjs:28-46","src/web.mjs:57-96"]}
{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#card-en","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH++ is a local operations tool for DeepSeek Harness, with a CLI, web console, and /dshpp plugin command. It summarizes session usage and estimated costs, manages model providers, backs up and restores configuration, and runs workflow regression checks. It requires Node.js 20 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-33","bin/dshpp.mjs:28-46","src/web.mjs:57-96"]}
