{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#feature-1","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH++ 的功能「会话用量汇总」：读取 Harness 会话日志并汇总调用量、输入输出 token、缓存命中率和估算费用。运行 dshpp usage，或在 Harness 中调用 /dshpp 查看简要汇总。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/usage.mjs:13-21","lib/index.js:12-22","bin/dshpp.mjs:38-40"]}
{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#feature-2","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH++ 的功能「配置快照」：创建 DSH_HOME 下 .env 与 settings 配置文件的时间戳备份；可列出、恢复或删除快照，恢复前会先保存当前状态。通过 dshpp backup 子命令操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/backup.mjs:10-12","src/backup.mjs:33-51","src/backup.mjs:75-90","bin/dshpp.mjs:34-37"]}
{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#feature-3","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH++ 的功能「本地网页控制台」：启动本机网页界面，展示状态、环境配置、备份、提供方、会话和用量等信息，并提供对应管理操作。运行 dshpp web，默认端口为 4848。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/web.mjs:57-96","src/web.mjs:110-121","bin/dshpp.mjs:45-46"]}
{"unit_id":"limlnx523__dsh-plus-plus#feature-4","repo":"limlnx523/dsh-plus-plus","commit":"8d208f36534c73dd6c65ad8574fe7b142a83894f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH++ 的功能「工作流回归检查」：运行一组固定的 Harness 任务，记录结果并与保存的基线比较，显示新增、改善或退化的用例。使用 dshpp test，可用 --case 指定用例。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/regression.mjs:1-8","bin/dshpp.mjs:45-46"]}
